        "jsCode": "// 1. Extract the Markdown text from final_markdown (fallback to output/text)\nconst aiContent = $input.first().json.final_markdown || $input.first().json.output || $input.first().json.text;\n\n// 2. Generate a dynamic filename using today's date and a random ID\nconst date = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\nconst randomId = Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000);\nconst filePath = `_posts/${date}-portfolio-update-${randomId}.md`;\n\n// 3. Convert the Markdown text into Base64 (Required by GitHub API)\nconst base64Content = Buffer.from(aiContent).toString('base64');\n\n// 4. Output the exact variables needed for the HTTP Request node\nreturn {\n  filename: filePath,\n  content: base64Content\n};"
